Package: autoschemaR
Title: Infer Relational Tables from CSV Files and Data Frames
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Adhni", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "amul0019@student.monash.edu")
Description: Discover bounded exact functional dependencies, preview a relational
    schema, and convert tabular data into SQLite tables with verified reconstruction.
    Export SQL, CSV, summary statistics and a self-contained HTML processing report.
    All inference and processing run in R without a Python runtime.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: DBI (>= 1.1.0), RSQLite (>= 2.2.0), jsonlite (>= 1.8.0), readr (>= 2.1.0), graphics, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), withr (>= 2.5.0), tools
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/adhni/autoschema
BugReports: https://github.com/adhni/autoschema/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
